{{- /*gotype: github.com/xujiahua/alertmanager-webhook-feishu/model.WebhookMessage*/ -}}
{
  "msg_type": "interactive",
  "card": {
    "schema": "2.0",
    "config": {
      "update_multi": true,
      "style": {
        "text_size": {
          "normal_v2": {
            "default": "normal",
            "pc": "normal",
            "mobile": "heading"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "header": {
      "title": {
        "tag": "plain_text",
        "content": "{{if eq .Status "firing"}}🚨 {{else}}✅ {{end}}{{.Level}} 告警: {{.SubTitle | default "Unknown"}}"
      },
      "subtitle": {
        "tag": "plain_text",
        "content": "{{.CommonLabels.alertname}}"
      },
      "template": "{{if eq .Status "firing"}}red{{else}}green{{end}}",
      "padding": "12px 12px 12px 12px"
    },
    "body": {
      "direction": "vertical",
      "padding": "12px 12px 12px 12px",
      "elements": [
        {
          "tag": "markdown",
          "content": "**📊 告警概览**\n- **状态**: {{if eq .Status "firing"}}🚨 触发{{else}}✅ 恢复{{end}}\n- **等级**: {{.Level | default .CommonLabels.severity | default "未知"}}\n",
          "text_align": "left",
          "margin": "0px 0px 0px 0px"
        },
       {
         "tag": "markdown",
         "content": "**📋 告警详情**\n{{range $index, $alert := .Alerts}}\n{{if gt (len $.Alerts) 1}}\n---\n**告警 {{add $index 1}}**\n{{else}}\n\n{{end}}- **状态**: {{$alert.Status | default "unknown"}}\n{{if gt (len $.Alerts) 1}}{{if $alert.Annotations.level}}- **等级**: {{$alert.Annotations.level}}\n{{else if $alert.Labels.severity}}- **等级**: {{$alert.Labels.severity}}\n{{end}}{{end}}- **触发时间**: {{$alert.StartsAt.Format "2006-01-02 15:04:05"}}\n{{if and (eq $alert.Status "resolved") (not $alert.EndsAt.IsZero)}}- **恢复时间**: {{$alert.EndsAt.Format "2006-01-02 15:04:05"}}\n{{end}}\n{{if $alert.Labels.desc}}- **描述**: {{$alert.Labels.desc | default "无描述"}}\n{{else if $alert.Annotations.description}}- **描述**: {{$alert.Annotations.description | default "无描述"}}\n{{end}}\n{{if and (ne $alert.Status "resolved") ($alert.Annotations.handling)}}- **处理建议**: {{$alert.Annotations.handling}}\n{{end}}\n{{if $alert.Labels}}- **标签信息**:\n{{range $key, $value := $alert.Labels}}  - {{$key}}: {{$value | truncate 50}}\n{{end}}{{end}}\n{{else}}无告警详情{{end}}",
         "text_align": "left",
         "text_size": "normal_v2",
         "margin": "0px 0px 0px 0px"
       },
        {
          "tag": "button",
          "text": {
            "tag": "plain_text",
            "content": "{{.ButtonName | default "📊 查看详情"}} "
          },
          "type": "default",
          "width": "default",
          "size": "medium",
          "behaviors": [
            {
              "type": "open_url",
              "default_url": "{{.Link}}"
            }
          ],
          "margin": "0px 0px 0px 0px"
        },
        {
            "tag": "div",
            "text": {
              "tag": "lark_md",
              "content": "{{- if .Teams}}👥 负责人: {{range .Teams}}<at id={{.}}></at>{{end}}{{end}}\n{{- if .OpenIDs}}🔔 通知: {{range .OpenIDs}}<at id={{.}}></at>{{end}}{{end}}"
            }
          }
      ]
    }
  }
}